//  RankVocabularyDE.swift
//  Hunch
//
//  ~10k frequency-ranked common German words for the Contexto-style rank in
//  German mode. Generated from the wordfreq corpus (lowercase, matching the
//  embedding and guess normalization). Never shown to the player. Words missing
//  from Apple's German embedding are skipped when ranking.
//

